This repository combines three kinds of material under three regimes:

1. SOFTWARE (the pipeline scripts, e.g. *.py) — MIT License
2. DATA, FIGURES, AND TEXT authored by Tyche Institute (normalized/, diffs/,
   baselines/, bundles/, evidence/, observatory/, figures/, paper/, and the
   Markdown documentation) — Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
   (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
3. UPSTREAM SOURCE DOCUMENTS under snapshots/ — the raw national trusted-list
   documents remain the property of their respective national scheme operators
   and the European Commission. They are redistributed here unmodified, as
   published, solely for research and reproducibility. No additional rights are
   claimed over them.

